## SpaceX Starship Flight 15 Ship Landing Viewing

**Price**: $69 per passenger (with launch ticket)<br>
**Dates**: ~12 or ~24 hours after launch (to be confirmed)<br>
**Key Times**: Checkin T-1:45 | Boarding T-1:15 | Departure T-0:45<br>
**Boarding Location**: [The Original Dolphin Watch, 33256 State Park Rd 100, South Padre Island, TX 78597](https://maps.app.goo.gl/S8dFn2MCT9JJMzZ48)<br>

* Great location to view the key events of the landing
* Around ≈4 miles / ≈6.5 km from launch pad
* Spectacular views of flip maneuver, landing burn, catch and pad
* Stable vessel, calm seas and open deck for excellent viewing
* Free parking, a guaranteed viewing spot and no need to show up many hours early
* If landing attempt aborted prior to checkin time, receive a full refund
<br>

